  "title": "Features-EEG",
  "description": "Electroencephalography recordings from 16 participants viewing rapid serial visual presentation streams of Gabor-like stimuli. The dataset was collected to study the temporal dynamics of visual feature coding and integration in perception. Stimuli were presented at 6.67 Hz and 20 Hz while participants performed an orthogonal fixation colour change detection task.",
  "methods_description": "Participants viewed fast streams of Gabor-like stimuli presented at 6.67 Hz and 20 Hz rates while EEG was recorded. They performed an orthogonal fixation colour change detection task. Sessions lasted about 1 hour.",
